          "src": "/assets/img/tei-borriggar-td100-2.webp"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "TD100 is an electric/hydraulic limited-access drill rig designed to safely install cased micropiles. The rig’s model number indicates the horsepower of the electric motor."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Its rubber tracks can contract to 1,219 mm to enter difficult drilling positions. The 100 hp motor allows it to drive all TEI-made rotary heads."
        },
